     "texto": [
      "**衣服** is clothes, **裤子**, pants and **鞋**, shoes. **裙子** is skirt and **外套**, coat or jacket. **件** counts garments; **双**, pairs.",
      "**号码** is number or size. **试穿** means to try on a garment."
