     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Colors",
     "texto": [
      "**红**, **白** and **黑** are red, white and black. **颜色** means color. To ask, you can say **你喜欢什么颜色？** («what color do you like?»). In Chinese the color doesn't change to agree with the garment, as in English."
